ry>\n\nPrevents nonrepresentative test tasks from contributing telemetry metadata.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Disables metadata collection for unit-test suites.\n- Disables collection for filtered default-enablement tests.\n- Preserves representative integration-test collection.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200btwilio-6.6/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes `testDisabled`. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bspring/\u200bspring-jms/\u200bspring-jms-6.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes unit tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bspring/\u200bspring-jms/\u200bspring-jms-2.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes unit tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200blettuce/\u200blettuce-5.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes regular and semconv unit tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bjms/\u200bjms-3.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes unit tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bjms/\u200bjms-1.1/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes unit tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bjedis/\u200bjedis-2.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes unit tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bhystrix-1.4/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes `testDisabled`. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bhibernate/\u200bhibernate-procedure-call-4.3/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes `testDisabled`. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bhibernate/\u200bhibernate-6.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes `testDisabled`. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bhibernate/\u200bhibernate-4.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes `testDisabled`. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bhibernate/\u200bhibernate-3.3/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes `testDisabled`. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bcouchbase/\u200bcouchbase-3.2/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Excludes unit tests. |\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n--